<!-- GOLDEN RULE -->
<div class="alert alert-danger">
<strong class="big">⛔ The Golden Rule: Enter the Warranty End Date FIRST, then move the card to "Repaired - Returned to Customer."</strong>
Moving the card to <strong>Repaired - Returned to Customer</strong> instantly texts and emails the customer their repair warranty end date, and starts the Warranty Extension offer. If the <strong>Warranty End Date</strong> field is empty or wrong at that moment, the customer gets a blank or wrong date, and the message <strong>will not resend</strong>.
</div>

