<!-- OVERVIEW -->
<div class="section-label">Overview</div>
<div class="section-title">What Is the Signia Hearing Aid Repair?</div>
<div class="card">
<p>The <strong>Signia Hearing Aid Repair</strong> is for customers whose Signia hearing aid is <strong>out of warranty</strong> and damaged or not working properly. It's a <strong>$299 one-time payment</strong> ($250 with code <code>JDSKXDH</code>), sold as a digital product in GHL Payments.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Includes:</strong> the repair, plus a <strong>6-month repair-only warranty</strong> that starts on the date the repair is completed.</li>
<li><strong>Repair-only</strong> means repairs are covered for 6 months. Loss and replacement are <strong>not</strong> covered.</li>
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> once repaired, the hearing aid is back under warranty, so the customer can now buy the <strong>12-month Warranty Extension</strong>. GHL offers it to them automatically.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:12px;">After checkout, the customer is sent straight to the registration page, <a href="https://hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-repair-registration" target="_blank">hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-repair-registration</a>, where they enter their hearing aid details and describe the problem. Three connected workflows handle the messages. Len handles the warranty check, shipping, the Signia repair and the final date.</p>
<div class="flow">
<span class="box a">Customer buys</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box a">Submits registration form</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len confirms out of warranty</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box a">Shipping instructions emailed</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Aid received · sent to Signia</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len enters Warranty End Date</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len moves card to Repaired</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box a">Customer notified · Won · Extension offer</span>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:0.85rem;">Product page: <a href="https://hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-hearing-aid-repair/product/signiarepairservices" target="_blank">hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-hearing-aid-repair/product/signiarepairservices</a></p>
</div>

