<div class="stage-item"><div class="stage-num">3</div><div>Received - Sent to Signia <span class="manual-badge">MANUAL — LEN</span><small>The hearing aid has arrived and the repair has been submitted to Signia.</small></div></div>
<div class="stage-item"><div class="stage-num">4</div><div>Repaired - Returned to Customer <span class="manual-badge">MANUAL — LEN</span><small>Repair done and Warranty End Date entered. Moving here sends the customer confirmation, marks the card Won, and starts the Extension offer.</small></div></div>
